                                        "unable to handle the packet with code "
                                        + pcode);
                          }
                          poff = poff + len + 4;

                          bos.position(bos.position() + len);
                      }
                      break;
                  case 0x0802:
                      log.warn("Encountered unhandled packet code 0x0802 (contour color) -- reading past.");
